tools.description:
Full-text search across all askPulse resources (genes, germplasm, genotyping datasets, files).

Filters (exact values): database e.g. 'Ensembl Plants', 'Legume Information System', 'GBIF genebank accessions';
entry_type e.g. 'Gene annotation', 'Germplasm', 'Genotyping Experiment', 'File';
species e.g. 'Pisum sativum', 'Vicia faba', 'Glycine max'. Returns total count, facet counts and the top hits with source URLs.
